{"symbol":"ORGANICREC","yahoo":"ORGANICREC.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Organic Recycling Systems Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Waste Management","website":"https://organicrecycling.co.in","about":"Organic Recycling Systems Limited, an environmental engineering company, provides waste management and valorisation solutions in India. The company is involved in the development, construction, and maintenance of waste-to-energy projects in the municipal solid waste (MSW) sector. It also offers engineering, procurement, and construction services; project management consultancy; and commissioning and recommissioning services. In addition, the company provides waste management consulting services for feasibility and DPR preparation, lender/owners engineering, and operational troubleshooting; and laboratory services for feedstock sampling and analysis, compost analysis, and digester analysis. Further, it offers segregation lines for MSW and dry waste segregation; anaerobic digesters and allied equipment; Marut drums for pulverising and recovery; and Sanjeevak carbonisation systems, a biomass-to-charcoal conversion system. The company serves project developers, municipal corporations, corporate institutions, and bulk generators. Organic Recycling Systems Limited was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Navi Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-30T12:07:08+00:00","quote":{"price":199.0,"prevClose":207.45,"marketCap":310.42,"high52":209.8,"low52":137.33,"pe":12.89,"bookValue":142.02,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":20.3,"shares":1.5599,"insiders":66.84,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-10-06","2023-10-09","2023-10-10","2023-10-11","2023-10-12","2023-10-13","2023-10-16","2023-10-17","2023-10-18","2023-10-19","2023-10-20","2023-10-23","2023-10-25","2023-10-26","2023-10-27","2023-10-30","2023-10-31","2023-11-01","2023-11-02","2023-11-03","2023-11-06","2023-11-07","2023-11-08","2023-11-09","2023-11-10","2023-11-13","2023-11-15","2023-11-16","2023-11-